\section{Unified Invariant Stack Derivation}

The global invariant stack is defined as:
\begin{equation}
  \mathcal{R}_{\text{global}}
  =
  \bigwedge_{i=1}^{4}
  \mathcal{R}_i,
\end{equation}
where each $\mathcal{R}_i$ corresponds to the invariant set of a
sovereign engine.

\subsection{Invariant Manifold}

Define the invariant manifold:
\begin{equation}
  \mathcal{I}
  =
  \{ \Psi \in \mathcal{M}_{\text{supr}} \mid \mathcal{R}_{\text{global}}(\Psi) = 1 \}.
\end{equation}

The suprakernel enforces:
\begin{equation}
  \Psi(t) \in \mathcal{I}
  \quad
  \forall t.
\end{equation}

