\section{Anomaly Dynamics: Full Derivation}

Residual anomaly is:
\begin{equation}
  S_{\text{anomaly}}
  =
  \Psi_{\text{obs}}
  -
  \Psi_{\text{model}}.
\end{equation}

The purge dynamic is:
\begin{equation}
  \frac{dS_{\text{anomaly}}}{dt}
  =
  -k_{\text{purge}} S_{\text{anomaly}}
  +
  S_{\text{inject}}.
\end{equation}

\subsection{Solution}

Solve the linear ODE:
\begin{equation}
  S(t)
  =
  S(0)e^{-k_{\text{purge}} t}
  +
  \int_0^t
  e^{-k_{\text{purge}} (t-\tau)}
  S_{\text{inject}}(\tau)
  \, d\tau.
\end{equation}

If $S_{\text{inject}} = 0$:
\begin{equation}
  S(t)
  =
  S(0)e^{-k_{\text{purge}} t}.
\end{equation}

Thus:
\begin{equation}
  \lim_{t \to \infty} S(t) = 0.
\end{equation}

